      ],
      "text": "TB has not been diagnosed, should be informed about the importance of seeking medical care if TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        310.0159606933594,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "symptoms continue, emerge, re-emerge or worsen.",
