        147.0169219970703
      ],
      "text": "2.6 Systematic screening for TB disease among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        145.02191162109375,
        421.0190124511719,
        169.81690979003906
      ],
      "text": "miners and others exposed to silica dust",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        183.78883361816406,
        491.6972351074219,
        198.23182678222656
      ],
      "text": "6. Current and former workers in workplaces with silica exposure should be systematically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        195.78883361816406,
        191.84483337402344,
        210.23182678222656
      ],
      "text": "screened for TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        209.24671936035156,
        433.1866760253906,
        226.4837188720703
      ],
      "text": "existing recommendation: strong recommendation, low certainty of evidence ( ).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        253.9585418701172,
        328.513671875,
        272.2285461425781
      ],
      "text": "2.6.1 Summary of evidence and rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        278.93438720703125,
        527.381591796875,
        293.3774108886719
      ],
      "text": "Exposure to silica dust and silicosis are among the strongest risk factors for TB, with a relative risk of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        289.34051513671875,
        527.40087890625,
        306.5775451660156
      ],
      "text": "(30) (31, 32) 2.8–39 for silicosis, depending on the severity of the disease  . Silicosis is common in miners  ,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.962084770202637,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        305.33453369140625,
        527.3815307617188,
        319.7775573730469
      ],
      "text": "which is a primary reason for the high incidence of TB among them, and this is often compounded",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.5345153808594,
        527.432373046875,
        332.9775390625
      ],
      "text": "by a high prevalence of HIV. TB patients with silicosis have an increased risk of death (RR: 3.0; 95% CI:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        328.94049072265625,
        527.4268798828125,
        346.1775207519531
      ],
      "text": "(33) 1.4–6.3)  . Thus, while the quality of the direct evidence is low for the benefit of TB screening in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        344.93450927734375,
        527.4114379882812,
        359.3775329589844
      ],
      "text": "employees in workplaces where they are exposed to silica, the GDG placed high value on ensuring",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.1344909667969,
        527.3829345703125,
        372.5775146484375
      ],
      "text": "that TB is diagnosed early in this risk group, which has a high likelihood of having undetected TB as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.3345031738281,
        527.4046020507812,
        385.77752685546875
      ],
      "text": "well as other pulmonary diseases that may be detected through screening. This recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.5345153808594,
        527.4367065429688,
        398.9775390625
      ],
      "text": "has not been changed from the 2013 guidelines as no new robust evidence was found to inform the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.7344970703125,
        256.12811279296875,
        412.1775207519531
      ],
      "text": "subject since the last guideline meeting.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.6011047363281,
        301.50067138671875,
        440.8711242675781
      ],
      "text": "2.6.2 Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        447.5769958496094,
        527.6346435546875,
        462.02001953125
      ],
      "text": "There is limited evidence on the effectiveness of different screening intervals. The GDG suggests",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        460.7770080566406,
        527.4400634765625,
        475.22003173828125
      ],
      "text": "that the screening interval should be no longer than 12 months if possible, while an interval shorter",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        473.9770202636719,
        527.4389038085938,
        488.4200439453125
      ],
      "text": "than 12 months may be more beneficial. To the extent possible, TB screening should be combined",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.177001953125,
        527.2806396484375,
        501.6200256347656
      ],
      "text": "with screening for other diseases and with health-promotion activities, as well as with efforts to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.37701416015625,
        527.407958984375,
        514.8200073242188
      ],
      "text": "improve working conditions (especially by reducing exposure to silica) and living conditions. During",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.5770263671875,
        527.4212646484375,
        528.02001953125
      ],
      "text": "employment, screening should be considered to be the responsibility of the employer, and countries",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        526.7769775390625,
        397.1282043457031,
        541.219970703125
      ],
      "text": "may have occupational health and safety legislation that addresses this.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        555.208251953125,
        475.4806823730469,
        580.0032348632812
      ],
      "text": "2.7 Systematic screening for TB disease among",
